@tag('Endorsed')
Dashboard seed_fy_solution_c_v2 {
  title: 'Fiscal Year Reporting on a Non-Calendar Year (Oct-Sep)'
  description: 'An Oct-Sep fiscal calendar defined once on the shared date dimension - no shifted dates, and no fiscal columns on any fact table. GMV by fiscal year, fiscal quarter and calendar month, with fiscal YTD and QTD.'
  block kpi_gmv: VizBlock {
    label: 'GMV'
    viz: MetricKpi {
      dataset: seed_c
      theme {
        metric_kpi {
          label {
            font_size: 12
          }
          value {
            font_size: 30
          }
        }
      }
      value: VizFieldFull {
        ref: r(seed_c.gmv)
        format {
          type: 'number'
          pattern: 'inherited'
        }
      }
      settings {
        aggregate_awareness {
          enabled: true
          debug_comments: true
        }
      }
    }
  }
  block v_gmv_by_fy: VizBlock {
    label: 'GMV by Fiscal Year'
    viz: ColumnChart {
      dataset: seed_c
      x_axis: VizFieldFull {
        label: 'Fiscal Year'
        ref: r(seed_c_dates.fiscal_year_label)
        format {
          type: 'text'
        }
      }
      y_axis {
        series {
          field: VizFieldFull {
            ref: r(seed_c.gmv)
            format {
              type: 'number'
              pattern: 'inherited'
            }
          }
        }
      }
      settings {
        row_limit: 5000
        sort {
          field_index: 0
          direction: 'asc'
          type: 'xaxis'
        }
        x_axis_label: 'Fiscal Year'
        x_axis_show_null_datetime: true
        aggregate_awareness {
          enabled: true
          debug_comments: true
        }
      }
    }
  }
  block v_gmv_by_fq: VizBlock {
    label: 'GMV by Fiscal Quarter'
    viz: ColumnChart {
      dataset: seed_c
      x_axis: VizFieldFull {
        label: 'Fiscal Quarter'
        ref: r(seed_c_dates.fiscal_year_quarter)
        format {
          type: 'text'
        }
      }
      y_axis {
        series {
          field: VizFieldFull {
            ref: r(seed_c.gmv)
            format {
              type: 'number'
              pattern: 'inherited'
            }
          }
        }
      }
      settings {
        row_limit: 5000
        sort {
          field_index: 0
          direction: 'asc'
          type: 'xaxis'
        }
        x_axis_label: 'Fiscal Quarter'
        x_axis_show_null_datetime: true
        aggregate_awareness {
          enabled: true
          debug_comments: true
        }
      }
    }
  }
  block t_wz3d: TextBlock {
    content: @md ### or;;
  }
  block t_on38: TextBlock {
    content: @md # GMV — Fiscal Reporting
### E-commerce orders, fiscal year basis;;
  }
  block t_0ynk: TextBlock {
    content: @md ### Reporting with fiscal year

This business closes its books on **30 September**, and names each year for the
year it ends in - so **FY 2026 runs 1 Oct 2025 to 30 Sep 2026**.

**Solution overview:**
* A dedicated date dimension table is created with `fiscal_*` fields populated (shifted by 3 months)
* Fiscal reporting is done off these fiscal fields
* No fact table/metrics are modified
* Filters are created specifically for fiscal filtering

**Try it:**
* Filter by fiscal year or quarter,
* Switch **Period** between full history, this fiscal year or quarter, and either of those to date.

The year and quarter axes are fiscal; the month axis is a real calendar month, because a fiscal calendar changes how months are *grouped*, not what a month is.;;
  }
  block t_joaz: TextBlock {
    content: @md <iframe src="https://dbdiagram.io/e/6a9704bfaed2f4f6be847270/6a97a81d5450bea1bec68418" width="100%" height="460" frameborder="0" allowtransparency="true" style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:6px;"></iframe>;;
  }
  block t_izpd: TextBlock {
    content: @md # The Modeling Setup
;;
  }
  block t_block_ha_card: block_ha_card()
  block t_ac1x: block_ha_card()
  block t_7tbc: block_ha_card()
  block v_jkpa: VizBlock {
    label: 'GMV by Month (calendar year-month)'
    viz: ColumnChart {
      dataset: seed_c
      x_axis: VizFieldFull {
        label: 'Month'
        ref: r(ecommerce_orders.created_at)
        transformation: 'datetrunc month'
        format {
          type: 'date'
          pattern: 'LLL yyyy'
        }
      }
      y_axis {
        series {
          field: VizFieldFull {
            ref: r(seed_c.gmv)
            format {
              type: 'number'
              pattern: 'inherited'
            }
          }
        }
      }
      settings {
        row_limit: 5000
        sort {
          field_index: 0
          direction: 'asc'
          type: 'xaxis'
        }
        x_axis_label: 'Month'
        x_axis_show_null_datetime: true
        aggregate_awareness {
          enabled: true
          debug_comments: true
        }
      }
    }
  }
  block t_atwk: block_ha_card()
  block t_q19w: block_ha_card()
  block v_z5lv: VizBlock {
    label: 'Total orders'
    viz: MetricKpi {
      dataset: seed_c
      theme {
        metric_kpi {
          label {
            font_size: 12
          }
          value {
            font_size: 30
          }
        }
      }
      value: VizFieldFull {
        ref: r(seed_c.total_orders)
        format {
          type: 'number'
          pattern: 'inherited'
        }
      }
      settings {
        aggregate_awareness {
          enabled: true
          debug_comments: true
        }
      }
    }
  }
  block v_o9lr: VizBlock {
    label: 'Fiscal Year Filter'
    viz: MarkdownViz {
      dataset: seed_c
      rows: [
        VizFieldFull {
          ref: r(seed_c_dates.fiscal_year_label)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
          uname: 'seed_c_dates_fiscal_year_label'
        },
        VizFieldFull {
          label: 'Fiscal Quarter'
          ref: r(seed_c_dates.fiscal_year_quarter)
          format {
            type: 'text'
          }
        },
        r(seed_c_dates.is_current_fiscal_quarter),
        r(seed_c_dates.is_current_fiscal_year),
        r(seed_c_dates.is_last_fiscal_quarter),
        r(seed_c_dates.is_last_fiscal_year)
      ]
      content: @md <style>
[data-uname="v_aql_selector"] .ci-viz-result,
[data-uname="v_aql_selector"] .h-full,
[data-uname="v_aql_selector"] .text-content,
[data-uname="v_aql_selector"] .vue-markdown { overflow: visible !important; }
[data-uname="v_aql_selector"] { z-index: 50 !important; position: relative; }

.fiscal-dropdown { width:100%; max-width:280px; font-size:12px; outline:none; }
.fiscal-dropdown-summary { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px;
height:32px; padding:6px 10px; border:1px solid #E4E4E7; border-radius:8px; background:#FFFFFF;
box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
color:#111827; font-weight:400; cursor:pointer; user-select:none; }
.fiscal-dropdown-summary::after { content:'▾'; flex:none; font-size:11px; color:#9CA3AF; transition:transform 160ms ease; }
.fiscal-dropdown-summary:hover { border-color:#C7C7CC; }
.fiscal-dropdown:focus-within .fiscal-dropdown-summary { border-bottom-left-radius:0; border-bottom-right-radius:0; border-color:#93B4FF; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(59,130,246,0.12); }
.fiscal-dropdown:focus-within .fiscal-dropdown-summary::after { transform:rotate(180deg); }

/* --- summary text: placeholder when empty, selected value when set --- */
.fd-value { min-width:0; overflow:hidden; white-space:nowrap; text-overflow:ellipsis; }
.fd-value::before { content:attr(data-placeholder); color:#9CA3AF; font-weight:400; }
.fd-value::after { color:#111827; font-weight:400; }
.fiscal-dropdown:has(.h-drill-selected) .fd-value::before { content:none; }
.fiscal-dropdown:has(.h-drill-selected) .fiscal-dropdown-summary { border-color:#D1D5DB; }

.fiscal-panel { display:none; background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #E4E4E7; border-top:none;
border-radius:0 0 8px 8px; max-height:300px; overflow-y:auto; outline:none;
box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
.fiscal-dropdown:focus-within .fiscal-panel { display:grid; grid-template-columns:20px 1fr;
align-items:center; padding:4px; border-color:#93B4FF; }

.fp-caret { grid-column:1; cursor:pointer; text-align:center; color:#9CA3AF;
font-size:10px; border-radius:4px; user-select:none; }
.fp-caret::after { content:'▸'; display:block; transition:transform 160ms ease; }
.fp-caret:has(.fp-toggle:checked)::after { transform:rotate(90deg); }
.fp-caret:hover { background:#F4F4F5; color:#111827; }
.fp-toggle { display:none; }

.fp-text { color:inherit; }

.fp-section { grid-column:1 / -1; padding:8px 10px 4px; font-size:10px; font-weight:600;
text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; color:#9CA3AF; user-select:none; }
.fp-section:first-child { padding-top:4px; }

.fp-quick { grid-column:2; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
padding:6px 10px; margin:1px 0; border:1px solid transparent; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer;
font-size:12px; font-weight:400; color:#111827; }
.fp-quick:hover { background:#F4F4F5; }
.fp-quick.h-drill-selected, .fp-quick:has(.h-drill-selected) { background:#EFF6FF; color:#1D4ED8; border-color:#BFDBFE; }
.fp-quick.h-drill-selected::after, .fp-quick:has(.h-drill-selected)::after { content:'✓'; font-size:11px; }

.fp-parent { grid-column:2; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
padding:6px 10px; margin:1px 0; border:1px solid transparent; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer;
font-size:12px; font-weight:400; color:#111827; }
.fp-parent:hover { background:#F4F4F5; }
.fp-parent.h-drill-selected, .fp-parent:has(.h-drill-selected) { background:#EFF6FF; color:#1D4ED8; border-color:#BFDBFE; }
.fp-parent.h-drill-selected::after, .fp-parent:has(.h-drill-selected)::after { content:'✓'; font-size:11px; }

.fp-child { grid-column:2; display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
padding:6px 10px 6px 20px; margin:1px 0; border:1px solid transparent; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer;
font-size:12px; font-weight:400; color:#374151; }
.fp-child:hover { background:#F4F4F5; }
.fp-child.h-drill-selected, .fp-child:has(.h-drill-selected) { background:#EFF6FF; color:#1D4ED8; border-color:#BFDBFE; }
.fp-child.h-drill-selected::after, .fp-child:has(.h-drill-selected)::after { content:'✓'; font-size:11px; }

{% map(rows) %}
/* dedupe repeated FY rows */
[data-fy-caret="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] ~ [data-fy-caret="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] { display:none !important; }
[data-fy-parent="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] ~ [data-fy-parent="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] { display:none !important; }

/* expand on caret click */
.fiscal-panel:has(.fp-caret[data-fy-caret="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] .fp-toggle:checked) [data-fy-child="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] { display:flex !important; }

/* keep the group expanded when something inside it is selected */
.fiscal-panel:has([data-fy-child="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] .h-drill-selected, [data-fy-child="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"].h-drill-selected) [data-fy-child="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] { display:flex !important; }
.fiscal-panel:has([data-fy-parent="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] .h-drill-selected, [data-fy-parent="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"].h-drill-selected) [data-fy-child="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] { display:flex !important; }

/* selected value -> summary */
.fiscal-dropdown:has([data-fy-parent="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"] .h-drill-selected, [data-fy-parent="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"].h-drill-selected) .fd-value::after { content:"{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.formatted }}"; }
.fiscal-dropdown:has([data-fq-child="{{ `Fiscal Quarter`.raw }}"] .h-drill-selected, [data-fq-child="{{ `Fiscal Quarter`.raw }}"].h-drill-selected) .fd-value::after { content:"{{ `Fiscal Quarter`.formatted }}"; }
{% end %}

/* quick preset wins the summary label */
.fiscal-dropdown:has(.fp-quick[data-quick="this_fq"].h-drill-selected, .fp-quick[data-quick="this_fq"] .h-drill-selected) .fd-value::after { content:"This fiscal quarter"; }
.fiscal-dropdown:has(.fp-quick[data-quick="this_fy"].h-drill-selected, .fp-quick[data-quick="this_fy"] .h-drill-selected) .fd-value::after { content:"This fiscal year"; }
.fiscal-dropdown:has(.fp-quick[data-quick="last_fq"].h-drill-selected, .fp-quick[data-quick="last_fq"] .h-drill-selected) .fd-value::after { content:"Last fiscal quarter"; }
.fiscal-dropdown:has(.fp-quick[data-quick="last_fy"].h-drill-selected, .fp-quick[data-quick="last_fy"] .h-drill-selected) .fd-value::after { content:"Last fiscal year"; }
</style>

<div class="fiscal-dropdown" tabindex="0">
<div class="fiscal-dropdown-summary"><span class="fd-value" data-placeholder="Fiscal period"></span></div>

<div class="fiscal-panel" tabindex="-1">
<div class="fp-section">Quick</div>
<h-drill row="2" value="true" class="fp-quick" data-quick="this_fq"><span class="fp-text">This FQ</span></h-drill>
<h-drill row="3" value="true" class="fp-quick" data-quick="this_fy"><span class="fp-text">This FY</span></h-drill>
<h-drill row="4" value="true" class="fp-quick" data-quick="last_fq"><span class="fp-text">Last FQ</span></h-drill>
<h-drill row="5" value="true" class="fp-quick" data-quick="last_fy"><span class="fp-text">Last FY</span></h-drill>
<div class="fp-section">Specific</div>
{% map(rows) %}
<label class="fp-caret" data-fy-caret="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}">
<input type="checkbox" class="fp-toggle">
</label>
<h-drill row="0" value="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}" class="fp-parent" data-fy-parent="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"><span class="fp-text">{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.formatted }}</span></h-drill>
<h-drill row="1" value="{{ `Fiscal Quarter`.raw }}" class="fp-child"
  data-fy-child="{{ `Fiscal Year Label`.raw }}"
  data-fq-child="{{ `Fiscal Quarter`.raw }}"><span class="fp-text">{{ `Fiscal Quarter`.formatted }}</span></h-drill>{% end %}
</div>
</div>    ;;
      settings {
        pagination_size: 500
        show_row_total: true
        show_column_total: true
        sorts: [
          SortSetting {
            key: 'seed_c_dates_fiscal_year_label'
            direction: 'desc'
          }
        ]
        aggregate_awareness {
          enabled: true
          debug_comments: true
        }
      }
    }
  }
  view: TabLayout {
    label: 'View 1'
    tab view_1: CanvasLayout {
      label: 'The final report'
      width: 1460
      height: 1220
      grid_size: 20
      block kpi_gmv {
        position: pos(60, 240, 180, 80)
        layer: 4
      }
      block v_gmv_by_fy {
        position: pos(300, 240, 420, 340)
        layer: 1
      }
      block v_gmv_by_fq {
        position: pos(780, 240, 640, 340)
      }
      block t_wz3d {
        position: pos(-320, 340, 40, 40)
      }
      block t_on38 {
        position: pos(40, 40, 400, 100)
      }
      block t_block_ha_card {
        position: pos(280, 220, 460, 380)
      }
      block t_ac1x {
        position: pos(760, 220, 680, 380)
        layer: -1
      }
      block t_7tbc {
        position: pos(40, 620, 1400, 460)
        layer: 1
      }
      block v_jkpa {
        position: pos(60, 640, 1360, 420)
        layer: 1
      }
      block t_atwk {
        position: pos(40, 220, 220, 180)
        layer: 3
      }
      block t_q19w {
        position: pos(40, 420, 220, 180)
        layer: 1
      }
      block v_z5lv {
        position: pos(60, 440, 180, 80)
        layer: 2
      }
      block v_o9lr {
        position: pos(460, 40, 300, 260)
        layer: 1
      }
      mobile {
        mode: 'auto'
      }
    }
    tab tab_xamk: CanvasLayout {
      label: 'The setup'
      width: 1300
      height: 800
      grid_size: 20
      auto_expand_vertically: true
      mobile {
        mode: 'auto'
      }
      block t_0ynk {
        position: pos(20, 100, 560, 340)
      }
      block t_joaz {
        position: pos(600, 80, 680, 420)
      }
      block t_izpd {
        position: pos(20, 20, 1260, 60)
      }
    }
  }
  settings {
    timezone: 'Etc/UTC'
    cache_duration: 4320
    autorun_on_open: true
    autorun_on_changes: true
  }
}